  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered ranged weapons and can make shots that others find impossible. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Attacking at long range doesn't impose disadvantage on your ranged weapon attack rolls.</li><li>Your ranged weapon attacks ignore half and three-quarters cover.</li><li>Before you make an attack with a ranged weapon that you are proficient with, you can choose to take a -5 penalty to the attack roll. If that attack hits, you add +10 to the attack's damage.</li></ul>",
